{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026UL5KlgsaSm1793009098.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>統計顯示，強積金本月暫時錄得虧損。</p><p></p><p>根據顧問GUM統計，截至本月20日強積金虧損百分之1.5，相當於人均蝕5,200多元，同時將年初至今回報拖低至百分之4.6，人均仍有逾15,000元進帳。按地區分類，美股基金相對理想，本月暫時升百分之0.6，不過港股基金跌百分之4.4，亞洲基金表現最差，下跌百分之7.5。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:46.499982+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T06:58:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:58:07.257397+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T10:58:13.534225+00:00","content_hash":"c75c84c343e3c11d5d017a52ccb6f589f24e6060b8f147373bdc03108b43fce4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:46.499982+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}